<!-- 10 标签：两排每排 5 个，单选，默认"结婚"；图案用 icons/ 下 SVG（白事选中深灰无红） -->
<view class="tag-grid">
  <block wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="id">
    <view
      class="tagcell"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="onSelect"
    >
      <view class="tagcircle {{item.id === currentId ? (item.id === 'baishi' ? 'active-baishi' : 'active') : ''}}">
        <image class="tagimg" src="{{item.iconPath}}" mode="aspectFit" />
      </view>
      <text class="tagname songti {{item.id === currentId ? (item.id === 'baishi' ? 'name-baishi' : 'name-active') : ''}}">{{item.name}}</text>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
